gitignore
# ============ Unreal Engine 5：构建产物（可再生，绝不提交）============
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Build/
Script/

# ============ 工程 / IDE 生成文件 ============
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.vsconfig
*.sln
*.slnx
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.suo
*.user

# ============ 编译产物 ============
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.dll
*.dylib
*.exe

# ============ 隐私 / 密钥 / 凭据（硬规则：绝不上传）============
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.*
*.pem
.aws/
.ssh/
credentials.json
service-account*.json
*-service-account.json
*.secret
secrets.*
secret.*
.netrc
.git-credentials
.npmrc
.pypirc

# ============ 日志 / 系统杂项 ============
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini

# ============ 游戏资产（体积过大，不进 git）============
# 7.5G 的 Paragon 素材包 + .uasset 二进制，本地保留，用 build/网盘交付
Content/

# 嵌套的独立 git 仓库（有自己的 .git，外层不跟踪，避免 gitlink）
SecondAttempt/